// deliberately ugly and exhaustive.

@h1 Heading one
@h2 Heading two
@h3 Heading three
@h4 Heading four
@h5 Heading five
@h6 Heading six

#### Four hashes, which is a heading too

Prose with **bold**, *italic*, `code` and ==highlight==.
A second line, which should be a second line.

@quote A quote must never be a dark box, whatever the editor thinks.

---

@panel
  (accent=alert title="Parameters on the line below")
  Body text under them.

@panel(title="Parameters inline")
  Body text.

@table Q4
  Area, Owner, Notes
  Search, Ana, "one \n two"
  Export, Ben, single line

